WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:06.250
Welcome to Building Azure Security,
Chapter 7: Private Link, DNS and Key Vault.

2
00:00:06.250 --> 00:00:08.462
A private endpoint is an address.

3
00:00:08.462 --> 00:00:11.537
Whether anything uses
it is a DNS question,

4
00:00:11.537 --> 00:00:15.226
and whether the public path
is closed is a third one.

5
00:00:15.226 --> 00:00:16.975
The code asks all three.

6
00:00:16.975 --> 00:00:21.135
We'll start from Microsoft Learn's
Private Link commands for Key Vault,

7
00:00:21.135 --> 00:00:26.012
the zone group, the Cloud Adoption Framework's
central-zone pattern and Learn's Key

8
00:00:26.012 --> 00:00:28.952
Vault recommendations, see
what they leave to you,

9
00:00:28.952 --> 00:00:32.825
read the kit's check, and walk two
labs, the evidence and the dangers.

10
00:00:32.825 --> 00:00:35.510
The chapter has been
reviewed and approved,

11
00:00:35.510 --> 00:00:39.530
and the code is illustrative,
tested against a fictional estate.
